abstract: >
  Industrial Conveyor Digital Twin is a Unity-based industrial simulation
  and monitoring prototype featuring conveyor operation, virtual entry and
  exit sensors, package counting, motor temperature and current monitoring,
  cooling behaviour, emergency control, machine-state visualization, and
  CSV-based operational data logging. The project serves as the first
  implemented module of a broader Human-Centered AI Digital Twin research
  platform. Computer vision, explainable AI, predictive maintenance, and
  Extended Reality integration are planned research extensions and are not
  part of the current release.

